e_range_hint\",\"scene_trigger_rules\",\"usage_rule\",\"must_use_when_triggered\",\"fallback_allowed\",\"same_person_confirmation\"],\"properties\":{\"variant_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":80},\"alias_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":50},\"applicable_identity_state\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":100},\"outfit_type\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":60},\"outfit_description\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":180},\"visual_keypoints\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":60}},\"episode_range_hint\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":60},\"scene_trigger_rules\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"scene_names\",\"scene_types\",\"environment_or_time\",\"status_conditions\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_names\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60}},\"scene_types\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60}},\"environment_or_time\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60}},\"status_conditions\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60}}}},\"usage_rule\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":180},\"must_use_when_triggered\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"fallback_allowed\":{\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"same_person_confirmation\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":160}}}}}}},\"episode_level_usage_plan\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":12,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"episode_range\",\"main_character_aliases\"],\"properties\":{\"episode_range\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":60},\"main_character_aliases\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":6,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"character_id\",\"recommended_alias_name\",\"reason\"],\"properties\":{\"character_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60},\"recommended_alias_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":50},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}},\"scene_level_usage_plan\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":10,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"scene_name\",\"expected_alias_usage\"],\"properties\":{\"scene_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":1,\"maxLength\":80},\"expected_alias_usage\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":6,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"character_id\",\"alias_name\",\"reason\"],\"properties\":{\"character_id\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":60},\"alias_name\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":3,\"maxLength\":50},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"minLength\":2,\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}},\"special_naming_rules\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":5,\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":120}}}}}}", "debugLabel": "", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "systemPrompt", "label": "common:core.ai.Prompt", "valueType": "string", "isRichText": true, "placeholder": "common:core.app.tip.chatNodeSystemPromptTip", "maxLength": 100000, "renderTypeList": [ "textarea", "reference" ], "value": "你是“服装版本映射统筹编剧”。\n\n你的唯一任务：基于输入，输出可直接供开头冲突钩子、角色对话、剧本正文使用的结构化 appearance_mapping JSON。\n\n输入：\n【世界观JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yuozoGpo$}}\n【故事大纲】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.ayxWwSpE$}}\n【分集计划】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.pxtQY7p2$}}\n【当前最终人设JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.fFM0mroW$}}\n【当前最终场景JSON】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.iJudZHhM$}}\n【人物小传】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.yYYOuumm$}}\n【命名偏好】{{$VARIABLE_NODE_ID.m3UxJ8pD$}}\n\n硬性输出规则：\n- 只输出合法 JSON，不要 markdown、解释、标题、审核结果、自然语言说明。\n- 顶层必须且只能包含 appearance_mapping。\n- appearance_mapping 必须是 object，不能是 string。\n- appearance_mapping.characters 必须是数组，禁止写成“角色名 -> 对象”的字典。\n- 每个 characters[] 条目必须包含 character_id、canonical_name、story_role、same_person_anchor、default_name、forbidden_generic_names、outfit_variants。\n- 每个 outfit_variants[] 条目必须包含 variant_id、alias_name、applicable_identity_state、outfit_type、outfit_description、visual_keypoints、episode_range_hint、scene_trigger_rules、usage_rule、must_use_when_triggered、fallback_allowed、same_person_confirmation。\n- scene_trigger_rules 必须是 object，且包含 scene_names、scene_types、environment_or_time、status_conditions。\n- episode_level_usage_plan、scene_level_usage_plan、special_naming_rules 必须存在。\n- default_name 绝对不能为空；无法判断时直接使用 canonical_name。\n- forbidden_generic_names 至少包含“男主”“女主”“反派”“配角”。\n- alias_name 必须使用：角色中文全名(场景/状态/身份)。\n- variant_id 可机器可读；alias_name 不得用英文、拼音、snake_case、数字编号、版本1/版本2。\n- 禁止输出“核心场景：”文本、scene_setting、补丁说明。\n\n保守提速要求：\n- 普通配角通常 1 个 outfit_variants；核心角色 2-3 个，有强剧情理由才到 4 个。\n- 所有字符串尽量 1 句完成。\n- visual_keypoints、scene_names、scene_types、status_conditions 等数组只保留最关键 1-3 条。\n- episode_level_usage_plan 用连续区间合并，不要逐集堆满。\n- scene_level_usage_plan 只写影响服装或命名的关键场景，最多 10 条。\n\n正确输出结构示例：\n{\n \"appearance_mapping\": {\n \"mapping_principle\": \"按角色身份、场景和剧情状态绑定服装版本别名。\",\n \"global_naming_style\": \"角色中文全名(场景/状态/身份)\",\n \"characters\": [\n {\n \"character_id\": \"character_id\",\n \"canonical_name\": \"角色中文全名\",\n \"story_role\": \"角色功能\",\n \"same_person_anchor\": {\n \"stable_appearance_traits\": [\"稳定外貌特征\"],\n \"stable_recognition_points\": [\"稳定识别点\"],\n \"unchanged_core_impression\": \"换装后仍是同一人的核心印象\"\n },\n \"default_name\": \"角色中文全名\",\n \"forbidden_generic_names\": [\"男主\", \"女主\", \"反派\", \"配角\"],\n \"outfit_variants\": [\n {\n \"variant_id\": \"machine_readable_id\",\n \"alias_name\": \"角色中文全名(常态)\",\n \"applicable_identity_state\": \"适用身份或状态\",\n \"outfit_type\": \"服装类型\",\n \"outfit_description\": \"服装描述\",\n \"visual_keypoints\": [\"关键视觉点\"],\n \"episode_range_hint\": \"适用集数范围\",\n \"scene_trigger_rules\": {\n \"scene_names\": [\"场景名\"],\n \"scene_types\": [\"场景类型\"],\n \"environment_or_time\": [\"时间或环境\"],\n \"status_conditions\": [\"角色状态\"]\n },\n \"usage_rule\": \"触发这些条件时使用该 alias_name。\",\n \"must_use_when_triggered\": true,\n \"fallback_allowed\": false,\n \"same_person_confirmation\": \"外貌锚点不变，确认仍是同一角色。\"\n }\n ]\n }\n ],\n \"episode_level_usage_plan\": [\n {\n \"episode_range\": \"1-5\",\n \"main_character_aliases\": [\n {\n \"character_id\": \"character_id\",\n \"recommended_alias_name\": \"角色中文全名(常态)\",\n \"reason\": \"该区间主要状态。\"\n }\n ]\n }\n ],\n \"scene_level_usage_plan\": [\n {\n \"scene_name\": \"场景名\",\n \"expected_alias_usage\": [\n {\n \"character_id\": \"character_id\",\n \"alias_name\": \"角色中文全名(常态)\",\n \"reason\": \"该场景触发该服装版本。\"\n }\n ]\n }\n ],\n \"special_naming_rules\": []\n }\n}", "debugLabel": "", "description": "common:core.app.tip.systemPromptTip", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "history", "label": "common:core.module.input.label.chat history", "valueType": "chatHistory", "required": true, "max": 50, "min": 0, "renderTypeList": [ "numberInput", "reference" ], "value": 0, "debugLabel": "", "description": "workflow:max_dialog_rounds", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "quoteQA", "label": "", "valueType": "datasetQuote", "renderTypeList": [ "settingDatasetQuotePrompt" ], "debugLabel": "知识库引用", "description": "", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "fileUrlList", "label": "app:workflow.user_file_input", "valueType": "arrayString", "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "input" ], "value": [ [ "448745", "userFiles" ] ], "debugLabel": "文件链接", "description": "app:workflow.user_file_input_desc", "toolDescription": "" }, { "key": "userChatInput", "label": "workflow:user_question", "valueType": "string", "required": true, "selectedTypeIndex": 1, "renderTypeList": [ "reference", "textarea" ], "value": "按照提示词完成服装版本映射统筹任务即可。", "debugLabel": "", "toolDescription": "用户问题" } ], "outputs": [ { "id": "history", "key": "history", "type": "static", "valueType": "chatHistory", "valueDesc": "{\n obj: System | Human | AI;\n value: string;\n}[]", "label": "common:core.module.output.l